P3-STREAM-001 RED

Command:
  rtk bash -lc 'mise exec java@zulu-17.68.203.0 -- bash ./mvnw -pl search -am -Dtest=SearchDocumentIndexWorkerTest -DfailIfNoTests=false test -B'

Observed:
  SearchDocumentIndexWorkerTest ran 22 tests with 2 failures.
  futureSchemaIsNotProcessed expected zero processing but received one.
  malformedAggregateVersionIsNotProcessed expected zero processing but received one.

Root cause exposed:
  SearchDocumentIndexWorker accepted future schemaVersion and malformed aggregateVersion because the shared envelope was field-name-only and parseVersion silently returned 0.
